{"id": "DZ003", "subject": "event:dangzheng_minglu", "predicate": "造录", "value_text": "崔呈秀密付《天鉴录》《同志录》《点将录》", "time": {"era_text": "天启五年", "start": "1625-01-01", "end": "1625-12-31", "gregorian_year": 1625}, "place": "jingshi", "source": "zhuozhongzhi", "quote": "崔呈秀之通內也，始自呈秀之舊居停許秉彝導引，凡有字帖及《點將錄》《同志錄》《天鑒錄》，俱將原本付朝欽收掌。", "quote_status": "paraphrase_unverified", "layer": "record", "confidence": 0.9, "scale": "empire", "note": "阉党造名录株连东林。"}
{"id": "DZ004", "subject": "event:dangzheng_liuruoyu", "predicate": "著书", "value_text": "刘若愚著《酌中志》", "time": {"era_text": "崇祯十三年", "start": "1640-01-01", "end": "1640-12-31", "gregorian_year": 1640}, "place": "jingshi", "source": "zhuozhongzhi", "quote": "累臣於逆賢之側，絕無站處說，處於永貞又久遭猜妒，既不敢出宮門，何由而知外事？", "quote_status": "paraphrase_unverified", "layer": "record", "confidence": 0.8, "scale": "empire", "note": "作者自述著书背景。"}
{"id": "DZ005", "subject": "person:wei_zhongxian", "predicate": "掌权", "value_text": "魏忠贤掌东厂", "time": {"era_text": "天启三年", "start": "1623-01-01", "end": "1623-12-31", "gregorian_year": 1623}, "place": "jingshi", "source": "zhuozhongzhi", "quote": "三年冬，宋私宅閑住，逆賢掌東廠。", "quote_status": "paraphrase_unverified", "layer": "record", "confidence": 0.9, "scale": "empire", "note": ""}
{"id": "DZ006", "subject": "person:ke_shi", "predicate": "害胎", "value_text": "客氏、魏忠贤致张娘娘损元子睿胎", "time": {"era_text": "天启三年", "start": "1623-01-01", "end": "1623-12-31", "gregorian_year": 1623}, "place": "jingshi", "source": "zhuozhongzhi", "quote": "天啟三年，張娘娘覺孕，客氏、逆賢乃逐去宮人之異己者，故托不更事之宮人、答應，一日張娘娘偶腰痛，受捶過度，竟損元子睿胎。", "quote_status": "paraphrase_unverified", "layer": "record", "confidence": 0.8, "scale": "empire", "note": "宫廷内部斗争。"}
{"id": "DZ007", "subject": "person:wei_zhongxian", "predicate": "出行", "value_text": "魏忠贤远出涿州，仪仗奢华", "time": {"era_text": "天启四年", "start": "1624-01-01", "end": "1624-12-31", "gregorian_year": 1624}, "place": "jingshi", "source": "zhuozhongzhi", "quote": "天啟元年十二月，逆賢雖出外尚未敢數，尚未敢遠，至四年以後外廷暗助，羽翼既成，仗客氏、王體乾、李永貞、石元雅、塗文輔在內，遂遠至涿州等處。", "quote_status": "paraphrase_unverified", "layer": "record", "confidence": 0.8, "scale": "empire", "note": "描述魏忠贤权势扩张。"}
{"id": "DZ008", "subject": "person:wei_zhongxian", "predicate": "伏法", "value_text": "魏忠贤尸体被磔，枭首河间", "time": {"era_text": "崇祯元年", "start": "1628-01-01", "end": "1628-12-31", "gregorian_year": 1628}, "place": "jingshi", "source": "zhuozhongzhi", "quote": "崇禎元年二月十一日，該御史卓邁等遵奉明旨，將逆賢原屍磔之，梟首於河間西門之外，天下快之，猶恨其不生正典刑也。", "quote_status": "paraphrase_unverified", "layer": "record", "confidence": 0.9, "scale": "empire", "note": ""}
{"id": "DZ009", "subject": "person:wei_zhongxian", "predicate": "出身", "value_text": "魏忠贤原名李进忠，直隶宁肃县亡赖子", "time": {"era_text": "天启四年", "start": "1624-01-01", "end": "1624-12-31", "gregorian_year": 1624}, "place": "jingshi", "source": "zhuozhongzhi", "quote": "魏忠賢原名李進忠，直棣寧肅縣亡賴子也。", "quote_status": "paraphrase_unverified", "layer": "record", "confidence": 0.9, "scale": "empire", "note": "魏忠贤出身背景。"}
{"id": "DZ010", "subject": "person:wei_zhongxian", "predicate": "奢侈", "value_text": "魏忠贤服色僭制，奢侈性成", "time": {"era_text": "天启四年", "start": "1624-01-01", "end": "1624-12-31", "gregorian_year": 1624}, "place": "jingshi", "source": "zhuozhongzhi", "quote": "逆賢奢侈性成，服色僭制，出外戴束髮冠，端陽懸珍珠牌穗。", "quote_status": "paraphrase_unverified", "layer": "record", "confidence": 0.8, "scale": "empire", "note": "描述魏忠贤生活奢靡。"}
{"id": "DZ011", "subject": "person:wei_zhongxian", "predicate": "生日", "value_text": "魏忠贤生日，送寿礼者众多", "time": {"era_text": "天启四年", "start": "1624-01-01", "end": "1624-12-31", "gregorian_year": 1624}, "place": "jingshi", "source": "zhuozhongzhi", "quote": "逆賢生於戊辰年正月晦日，自元宵節後送壽禮者，做法事祝延簽字者，每早乾清宮兩丹墀幾滿。", "quote_status": "paraphrase_unverified", "layer": "record", "confidence": 0.8, "scale": "empire", "note": "反映魏忠贤权势。"}
{"id": "DZ012", "subject": "person:wei_zhongxian", "predicate": "乱政", "value_text": "魏忠贤乱政，改司礼监规制", "time": {"era_text": "天启四年", "start": "1624-01-01", "end": "1624-12-31", "gregorian_year": 1624}, "place": "jingshi", "source": "zhuozhongzhi", "quote": "自逆賢專政，將司禮監外層拆毀，改為大門，向西殊失次第。", "quote_status": "paraphrase_unverified", "layer": "record", "confidence": 0.8, "scale": "empire", "note": "魏忠贤破坏制度。"}
{"id": "DZ013", "subject": "event:dangzheng_xiong_feng", "predicate": "私怨杀人的制度性背景", "value_text": "现代学界指出，熊廷弼之死固有其广宁兵败之责，但冯铨借小说《辽东传》私怨、以讲筵袖奏构陷，显示辽东战事已被京中党争与内廷私怨所劫持；阉党专政下，边事成败不再纯由军功评定。", "time": {"era_text": "天启五年", "start": "1625-01-01", "end": "1625-12-31", "gregorian_year": 1625}, "place": "jingshi", "source": "modern", "quote": "辽东之败，半在战场，半在朝堂。", "quote_status": "paraphrase_unverified", "layer": "scholarship", "confidence": 0.85, "scale": "empire", "note": "亦有观点强调熊廷弼刚愎、处置辽事确有失当，不宜尽归党争。"}
